<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="description" content="اشتراك البريميوم — الخاصية لا تزال قيد البرمجة والتطوير، انتظرونا!">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Kratos Premium — قريباً" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="اشتراك البريميوم — الخاصية لا تزال قيد البرمجة والتطوير، انتظرونا!" />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://kratos-botdashboard.onrender.com/og-image.jpg" />
  <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
  <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
  <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Kratos Dashboard — لوحة تحكم نظام كراتوس" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://kratos-botdashboard.onrender.com" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://kratos-botdashboard.onrender.com/og-image.jpg" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#a855f7" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <style>
:root{--pb:#06060e;--pc:#0c0c1a;--pbo:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--pt:rgba(255,255,255,0.87);--pm:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);--pg1:#f5b301;--pg2:#d97706;--pgg:rgba(245,179,1,0.18)}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;background:var(--pb);color:var(--pt);overflow-x:hidden;direction:rtl}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.p-page{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#06060e 0%,#0a0a1e 40%,#06060e 100%)}
.p-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 40% at 30% 0%,rgba(245,179,1,0.07) 0%,transparent 60%),radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 35% at 70% 100%,rgba(217,119,6,0.05) 0%,transparent 55%)}
.p-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.2;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:50px 50px}
.p-orb{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(130px);animation:pDrift 16s ease-in-out infinite}
.p-o1{width:380px;height:380px;background:var(--pg1);top:-120px;right:15%;opacity:0.07}
.p-o2{width:280px;height:280px;background:var(--pg2);bottom:-100px;left:15%;opacity:0.05;animation-delay:-8s}
@keyframes pDrift{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1)}50%{transform:translate(25px,-30px) scale(1.08)}}
.p-wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;width:100%;max-width:560px;padding:24px}
.p-card{background:rgba(12,12,26,0.7);backdrop-filter:blur(24px);border:1px solid var(--pbo);border-radius:18px;padding:44px 32px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.p-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--pg1),var(--pg2),transparent);opacity:0.5}
.p-icon{width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.9rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(245,179,1,0.12),rgba(217,119,6,0.14));border:1px solid rgba(245,179,1,0.2);position:relative;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(245,179,1,0.15)}
.p-icon i{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg1),var(--pg2));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.p-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:rgba(245,179,1,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(245,179,1,0.12);padding:4px 14px;border-radius:100px;font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--pg1);margin-bottom:14px}
.p-pill i{font-size:0.45rem;color:var(--pg1);animation:pBlink 1.4s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes pBlink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}
.p-card h1{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}
.p-card h1 em{font-style:normal;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg1),var(--pg2));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text}
.p-card .p-sub{font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--pm);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:8px}
.p-lang{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin:22px 0 8px}
.p-lang-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);border:1px solid var(--pbo);text-align:right}
.p-lang-flag{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.9rem;flex-shrink:0}
.p-lang-item strong{display:block;font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:2px}
.p-lang-item span{font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--pm);line-height:1.7}
.p-dev{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin:20px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(245,179,1,0.05);border:1px dashed rgba(245,179,1,0.25)}
.p-dev-bar{display:flex;gap:5px}
.p-dev-bar span{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pg1);animation:pBounce 1.2s ease-in-out infinite}
.p-dev-bar span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}
.p-dev-bar span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}
@keyframes pBounce{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.5}50%{transform:translateY(-4px);opacity:1}}
.p-dev-text{font-size:0.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--pt)}
.p-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}
.p-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:0.85rem;transition:all 0.25s;cursor:pointer;border:none}
.p-btn-g{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg1),var(--pg2));color:#141004;box-shadow:0 3px 14px var(--pgg);font-weight:700}
.p-btn-g:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 24px var(--pgg)}
.p-btn-d{background:rgba(88,101,242,0.12);color:#818cf8;border:1px solid rgba(88,101,242,0.15)}
.p-btn-d:hover{background:rgba(88,101,242,0.18)}
.p-btn-s{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:var(--pm);border:1px solid var(--pbo)}
.p-btn-s:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);color:white}
.p-foot{margin-top:18px;font-size:0.72rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2)}
@media(max-width:600px){.p-card{padding:32px 20px}.p-wrap{padding:16px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="p-page">
    <div class="p-bg"></div>
    <div class="p-grid"></div>
    <div class="p-orb p-o1"></div>
    <div class="p-orb p-o2"></div>
    <div class="p-wrap">
      <div class="p-card">
        <div class="p-icon"><i class="fas fa-crown"></i></div>
        <div class="p-pill"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> قريباً — Coming Soon</div>
        <h1>اشتراك <em>البريميوم</em></h1>
        <p class="p-sub">الخاصية لا تزال في طريقها للبرمجة والتطوير — <strong style="color:#f5b301">انتظرونا</strong>، سنطلقها قريباً.</p>

        <div class="p-lang">
          <div class="p-lang-item">
            <div class="p-lang-flag" style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.1);color:#34d399"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div>
            <div>
              <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)">العربية</strong>
              <span>هذه الخاصية لا تزال قيد البرمجة والتطوير، ونعمل عليها بجد لتصل إليك بأفضل شكل. انتظرونا قريباً!</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-lang-item">
            <div class="p-lang-flag" style="background:rgba(96,165,250,0.1);color:#60a5fa"><i class="fas fa-language"></i></div>
            <div>
              <strong style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85)">English</strong>
              <span>This feature is still under development. We're working hard to bring it to you — stay tuned!</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-dev">
          <div class="p-dev-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <span class="p-dev-text">قيد التطوير — Under Development</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-actions">
          <a href="https://discord.gg/ENQut4HHKb" target="_blank" class="p-btn p-btn-d"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i> تواصل معنا عبر الديسكورد</a>
          <a href="/" class="p-btn p-btn-s"><i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i> العودة للصفحة الرئيسية</a>
          <% if (locals.user) { %><a href="/home" class="p-btn p-btn-g"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> لوحة التحكم</a><% } %>
        </div>
        <div class="p-foot">Kratos Dashboard &copy; 2026 — Premium</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>